  "details": "In Graph espeically it's very easy to try and sync something like a GameObject which can't be synced. When this happens, no syncing events will occur for this object.\nAt a minimum it would be best to warn Graph users via an error if they try and sync something that is unsyncable. \nIt would be nice to have this warning for things like U# as well, but this is a more acute problem for Graph users.",
